{'symbol': 'MCK', 'date': '2022-04-28 08:00:00', 'title': 'MCKESSON DECLARES QUARTERLY DIVIDEND', 'text': 'IRVING, TEXAS--(BUSINESS WIRE)--THE BOARD OF DIRECTORS OF MCKESSON CORPORATION (NYSE:MCK) YESTERDAY DECLARED A REGULAR DIVIDEND OF 47 CENTS PER SHARE OF COMMON STOCK. THE DIVIDEND WILL BE PAYABLE ON JULY 1, 2022, TO STOCKHOLDERS OF RECORD ON JUNE 1, 2022. ABOUT MCKESSON CORPORATION MCKESSON CORPORATION IS A DIVERSIFIED HEALTHCARE SERVICES LEADER DEDICATED TO ADVANCING HEALTH OUTCOMES FOR PATIENTS EVERYWHERE. OUR TEAMS PARTNER WITH BIOPHARMA COMPANIES, CARE PROVIDERS, PHARMACIES, MANUFACTURERS,'}